Personal Portfolio Website UI

Overview

This project is a modern personal portfolio website designed to showcase professional skills, projects, achievements, and contact information in a clean and visually appealing format.

The portfolio features a premium dark theme with purple neon accents, responsive design elements, and organized sections that highlight technical expertise and personal branding.

Features

- Modern Dark Theme UI
- Responsive Design
- Hero Section
- About Me Section
- Skills Showcase
- Project Portfolio Cards
- Achievements & Certifications
- Contact Section
- Professional Personal Branding
- Clean and User-Friendly Layout

Tech Stack

- HTML5
- Tailwind CSS
- JavaScript
- Responsive Web Design
- UI/UX Design Principles

